sequenceDiagram
    actor Test as Integration probe
    participant O as Orders API
    participant DB as Orders PostgreSQL
    participant K as Kafka broker
    participant C as Debezium Connect
    participant H as Order History
    Test->>C: Stop Connect
    Test->>K: Stop broker
    Test->>O: Synthetic checkout
    O->>DB: Commit order + immutable outbox events
    Note over DB: Source of truth remains durable during outage
    Test->>K: Start broker; await healthy
    Test->>C: Start connector; await RUNNING task
    C->>DB: Resume retained logical-decoding position
    C->>K: Publish outbox events
    K->>H: Deliver partition records
    H->>H: Deduplicate IDs and apply sequences
    Test->>H: Assert complete order, matching event IDs, zero lag
